# Bar Inventory + Admin stock setup (remember)

## Goal
Admin sets up stock on **Add Item** *or* **Bar Inventory → Add stock**. Bar Manager runs daily stock on **Bar Inventory** (SharedUI). Mother is hub; Client online to Mother only.

## Phase 0 — product rules (LOCKED)

| Rule | Locked value |
|--|--|
| Setup owner | **Admin only** — **Add Item / Edit Item** *or* **Bar Inventory → Add stock** |
| Daily ops owner | **Bar Manager** (and Admin) — on **Bar Inventory** |
| Track flag | **Track in Bar Inventory** On/Off per menu item |
| One stock → many products | **Yes** (e.g. one wine stock → glass + bottle) |
| Sell vs stock | Menu item sells; **stock item** counts shelf qty |
| Client | Same SharedUI Bar Inventory; data via Mother (**no Add stock** on Client) |
| Auto stock-out on sale | **Phase 5** — Mother deducts by sell portion (rules locked below) |
| Negative stock on sale | **Allow** — soft warning / audit flag; **do not block** sell or pay |
| Role | **Bar Manager** (`UserRole.BarManager`) — inventory-only nav |
| Capability | `pos.inventory.bar.view` |
| Terminal Access | `pos.bar_inventory` (label **Bar Inventory**) |

### Explicit non-goals (early phases)
- No HMRC / cloud inventory filing
- No Client→cloud
- No full supplier ERP / auto PO email
- No Receive / Count / Waste inside Add Item

## Build order
0. **Phase 0** — lock rules ✅
1. **Phase 1** — Data model (stock master + menu link) ✅
2. **Phase 2** — Admin Add Item Stock UI ✅
3. **Phase 3** — Bar Inventory live list ✅
4. **Phase 4** — Receive / Count / Waste ✅
5. **Phase 5** — Sale deduction ✅
6. **Phase 6** — Reliability / Access / polish ✅
7. **Phase 7** — QA checklist (locked below) ← you run manual till

### Phase 0 decision (Track Off)
Keep stock link inactive — hide details; retain `bar_stock_item_id` so re-enable is easy.

### Phase 2–3 shipped
- Add Item **Stock / Bar Inventory** section (Drink auto-shows; Food via expand)
- Track On → **multi-SKU rows** (SKU picker + ml per sale); create stock on **Bar Inventory → Add stock** first
- Junction table `menu_item_bar_stock_components` (legacy single `bar_stock_item_id` migrates on load)
- Bar Inventory board lists tracked stock (name, unit, on-hand, OK/Low vs par)
- Mother host loads locally; Client via `GET /api/client/bar-inventory`
- Empty: “No tracked items — Admin can tap Add stock…”

### Admin Add stock on Bar Inventory (shipped)
- Mother Admin only: **Add stock** button → SharedUI dialog
- Fields: SKU, name, category chips + **typed custom category**, 1 bottle = ml, opening bottles, par
- Live calc: bottles × ml = total ml; `pack_size` = ml/bottle; `on_hand` = bottles
- Custom categories appear as filter chips for later find
- Client never creates stock (Ask Admin on Mother)

### Sections + Usage & order (shipped)
- Stock `bar_section`: Wine / Soft Drink / Spirit / Beer / Other **+ Admin-typed custom**
- Bar Inventory chips: section filters (no All); Receive/Count/Waste pickers follow section
- Suggested Order shows Low + suggest qty; **Usage & order** report: Used / Left / Par / Suggest + supplier footer
- Used v1 = waste + negative count variance (sales usage after Phase 5)
- Bottle suggest qty ignores ml pack_size (suggest bottles to par)

