## Phase 6 — Reliability, Access, polish (LOCKED — after Phase 4–5 code)

### Goal
Access and sync behave like **Loyalty / Gift Cards**: Terminal Access flips menus without reinstall; Client mutates only online to Mother; board stays fresh.

### Access (locked)

| Surface | Rule |
|--|--|
| **Bar Manager role** | Inventory-only nav on Mother + Client (`UserRole.BarManager`) — **already started** |
| **Terminal Access** | `pos.bar_inventory` / label **Bar Inventory** — grant via Access; **already started** |
| **Capability** | `pos.inventory.bar.view` for board + ops |
| **Add Item Stock section** | **Admin only** — hide/disable Stock / Bar Inventory block for non-Admin (Manager/Bar Manager cannot change track/link) |
| **Bar Inventory ops** | Bar Manager + Admin only; Cashier / other roles cannot open mutate tiles |
| **Client menu refresh** | `GET /api/client/access` + **Update All** + WS **`features.updated`** show/hide Bar Inventory without reinstall (same as Gift Cards) |

### Offline / last-good (locked)

| Mode | Behaviour |
|--|--|
| Client **offline** mutate (Receive/Count/Waste) | **Refuse** — `ClientOperation.BarInventory`; clear message; no local ledger write |
| Client **offline** board read | **Show last-good** cached board if present (warm SQLite/cache from last successful `GET`); status: “Mother offline · showing last saved stock” |
| Cold offline (no cache) | Empty + refuse; do not invent rows |
| Mother offline to cloud | **N/A** — stock is local Mother MariaDB only (never Client→cloud) |

### Sync / freshness (locked)

| Mechanism | Behaviour |
|--|--|
| WS **`barinventory.updated`** (or `stock.updated`) | Mother publishes after successful Receive/Count/Waste/sale deduct; Client open Bar Inventory refreshes board quietly |
| Update All | Refreshes access features + pulls latest board into cache |
| Quiet safety-net | Optional ~45s pull while Bar Inventory page visible (match Client live-till pattern); no toast when warm |
| Mother host | Local DB — no WS required for self; still publish for Clients |

### Soft notes (locked)

| Note | When |
|--|--|
| Untracked drinks sold a lot | On Bar Inventory (Admin/Bar Manager): soft amber note when Drink/Alcohol menu items with **Track Off** appear often in recent paid sales (simple v1: top N untracked drink SKUs in last 7 days). Copy: “Consider Track On for high-volume drinks.” |
| Not a blocker | Note is advisory only — no auto-enable Track |
| Empty / none | Hide the note when no candidates |

### Diagnostics (locked — Loyalty/Gift pattern)
- Sync diagnostics: last Bar Inventory op (Mother vs Client source, success/fail, stock id)
- Sticky idempotency already required in Phase 4; Phase 6 verifies keys survive retry + restart without double movement

### Explicit non-goals (Phase 6)
- Do **not** Client→cloud stock
- Do **not** offline mutate queue that later auto-applies (refuse cleanly; staff retry online)
- Do **not** redesign Mother TopBar / Client header into SharedUI
- Do **not** soft-note Food Track Off (drinks/alcohol focus v1)

### Already started (do not regress)
- Bar Manager role + nav
- `pos.bar_inventory` feature key + Client gate on Bar Inventory page
- `ClientOperation.BarInventory` online-only evaluate
- `GET /api/client/bar-inventory` board

### Done when
1. Toggle Terminal Access Bar Inventory → Update All or `features.updated` → menu appears/hides on Client.
2. Non-Admin cannot edit Add Item Stock section.
3. Offline Client: mutate refused; last-good board still paints when cache warm.
4. Mother Receive → Client board updates via WS / refresh without reinstall.
5. Soft note appears for busy untracked drinks (when data qualifies).
6. Feels like Loyalty/Gift Cards for access + online-only mutate.

### Phase 6 shipped
- Add Item Stock section gated Admin-only (hide + save refuse)
- Client last-good board file cache + offline banner “Mother offline · showing last saved stock”
- WS `barinventory.updated` quiet refresh on Client Bar Inventory / Bar Manager workspace
- Soft amber advisory from Mother (Track Off Drink/Alcohol sold ≥3 in last 7 days)
- Sync diagnostics: `ClientBarInventoryDiagnostics`
- Quiet ~45s pull while `BarInventoryPage` visible; MainPage silent sync also refreshes inventory

