## Phase 7 — QA checklist (LOCKED)

Manual till required after Phases 4–6 (and Phase 5 for sale rows). Code-path review alone is not enough for printers/WS timing.

| # | Check | Expect |
|--|--|--|
| 1 | Admin **Track On** for a wine → save | Item appears on Bar Inventory (Mother + Client) |
| 2 | Admin **Track Off** same item | Disappears from Bar Manager **list**; `bar_stock_items` row may remain for history / re-link |
| 3 | Two menu SKUs (glass + bottle) → **one** stock; portions differ | Board shows one stock row; sale deduct (Phase 5) uses each SKU’s portion |
| 4 | **Receive / Count / Waste** math | On-hand matches; waste refuses overdraw; count sets absolute + variance audited |
| 5 | Pack receive **1 case = N bottles** | `on_hand` += N × pack when stock unit is bottle |
| 6 | On-hand ≤ par → **Suggested Order** | Only Low rows; OK rows hidden in that filter |
| 7 | Bar Manager **Mother + Client** | Same on-hand after refresh |
| 8 | Non–Bar Manager / Access off | Cannot open Bar Inventory ops (Mother route + Client menu) |
| 9 | Non-Admin | No Stock section edit on Add Item |
| 10 | **Sale deduction** (after Phase 5) | Glass → portion; bottle SKU → bottle; Send+Pay once; negative allowed |
| 11 | Restart Mother after Receive | **No double movements** (idempotency / no job replay) |
| 12 | Offline Client | Mutate refused; last-good read if cached |
| 13 | Update All / `features.updated` | Menu grant flips without reinstall |
| 14 | Weekly Report | Shows week’s Receive/Count/Waste (and sales once Phase 5 lives) |

**Done when:** checklist above passed on a real Mother + Client build.

## Architecture reminder
SharedUI = chrome only. Mother owns MariaDB stock + movements. Client never owns the ledger.
